WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:04.200
I'm not drunk; I don't need hangover soup.

00:04.280 --> 00:07.440
Is Your Highness afraid...

00:07.720 --> 00:09.120
that I poisoned this soup?

00:18.280 --> 00:22.440
There, Your Highness. Can you put your mind at ease now?

00:30.600 --> 00:32.600
I brewed it with soothing medicinal herbs;

00:32.960 --> 00:35.293
you won't wake with a headache tomorrow.

00:46.240 --> 00:47.680
I ought to take my leave.

00:47.760 --> 00:49.760
Wan'er respectfully sees off Your Highness.

00:59.920 --> 01:01.320
Ruolan...

01:01.800 --> 01:04.480
Perhaps I should learn how they cook at other estates,

01:04.560 --> 01:08.987
lest someone fret you've grown tired of home cooking, or fear I'm letting you starve.

01:16.440 --> 01:20.000
You reek so heavily of wine; go and rest early.

01:20.080 --> 01:22.520
You stay up reading dossiers night after night;

01:22.600 --> 01:24.267
that flickering candlelight keeps me from sleeping.

01:25.280 --> 01:27.200
As my Lady commands.
